CHAPTER.VERS:
«A Psalm of David, when he was in the
That is, of Ziph (1Sa_23:14). wilderness of Judah.» O God, thou [art] my God; early will I seek thee: my soul
Though he was both hungry and in great distress, yet he made God above all meat and drink. thirsteth for thee, my flesh longeth for thee in a dry and thirsty land, where no water is;
